Bind Npc 31743 Zone 71

On greeting
    If player rebirth level < 1
        Say "(Unidentified language spoken) (Re..bir.th? I think he said Rebirth)"
        Topic "Close" goto close
    Else
        Say "Do you understand what I've just say? I see. You are the rebirth one. Welcome. My name is Dason. Could you please do me a favor?"
        If no topic fits
            Say "Even if you are the rebirth one, it is dangerous to encounter too many souls in a short time. Please comeback tomorrow."
            Topic "Close" goto close
